        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BLD125HMRFAL, Offset Hammered Boulder Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Boulder Door Handle has offset brackets. It is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Offset Square Boulder Door Pull has a hammered texture that makes it great for modern spaces. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/square-boulder-door-pull-first-impressions-bld125hmrsal\"><b>Square Boulder Door Pull with Straight Mounts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boulder 150 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BLD02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions BLD125HMRFAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BLD125018HMRFAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.05\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.80\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLD125024HMRFAL</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.05\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.80\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BLD125036HMRFAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.05\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.80\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
