                "description": "The Hammered Boulder Door Handle has offset brackets. It is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Offset Square Boulder Door Pull has a hammered texture that makes it great for modern spaces. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.",
